&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;「長期ビジョン『16Vision-10』」及び「第２次中期経営計画」を策定&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:2.3pt;min-height:2.3pt;"&gt;
